  "globalSearch-instructions-heading": "Koyiyo kaaletuwaa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Koyiyoogaa loo'issanaw koyiyoogee oottiyaabata oykkana danddayees. Oottiyaabati oottiyaabaa sunttaanne wagaa (:) malaatan shaakkidi xaafiyoogan erissettoosona. Leemisuwas, `list:Blocked` giya oottiyaabay *Blocked* giya sunttay de'iya mazgabaa giddon de'iya kaardiyaatussi xalla koyees. Wagay mela bessaa woykko dumma malaatata oykkikko, qofaa malaatatu giddon wottettana koshshees (leemisuwas `__operator_list__:\"To Review\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "De'iya oottiyaabata:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - erissettida *<title>* sunttaara gaittiya bookkiyaatun de'iya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - erissettida *<title>* sunttaara gaittiya mazgabaatun de'iya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - erissettida *<title>* sunttaara gaittiya ogeta giddon de'iya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - *<text>* oykkiya qofay de'iya kaardiyaata.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - *<color>* woykko *<name> -ara gaittiya malaatay de'iya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - `__operator_label__:<color>` woykko `__operator_label__:<name>` guuxxa xaafettaa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - *<username>* *yaraa* woykko *oosoy imettidaagaa* gidiya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - `user:<username>` guuxxa xaafettaa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - *<username>* *yaraa* gidiya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - *<username>* *oosoy imettidaagaa* gidiya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - *<username>* kaardiyaa medhdhidaagaa gidiya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - *<name>* dirijjitiyaas imettida bookkiyaa kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - *<name>* kifiliyaas imettida bookkiyaa kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` - ha77ippe doommidi *<n>* gallassaa gakkanaw wurssiyo kaardiyaata. `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__ wurssiyo gallassay aadhdhida kaardiyaata ubbaa bessees.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - *<n>* gallassaappe kase woykko guuxxa wode kase medhettida kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - *<n>* gallassaappe kase woykko guuxxa wode kase laamettida kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - *<status>* hayssatuppe issuwaa:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - naago sohuwaa efettida kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - naago sohuwaa efettidaanne efettibeenna kaardiyaata ubbaa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - wurssetta gallassay de'iya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - asa ubbaassi bookkiyaatun xalla de'iya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - bagga bookkiyaatun xalla de'iya kaardiyaata",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - *<field>* hayssatuppe issuwaa: `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` woykko `__predicate_member__`. *<field>* sinttan `-` wottiyoogee he saaxiniyan wagay baynnaageeta koyees (leemisuwas `has:-due` wurssiyo gallassay baynna kaardiyaata koyees).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - *<sort-name>* hayssatuppe issuwaa: `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` woykko `__predicate_modified__`. Gitaappe guuxxaakko maaranaw, maaraa sunttaa sinttan `-` wotta.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - *<n>* issi sinttan bessettana koshshiya kaardiyaata qoodaa erissiya loo'o kumetta qoodaa.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "Daro oottiyaabati erissettana danddayoosona.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Issi mala oottiyaabati *WOYKKO* gididi gaittettoosona. Hanotatuppe issuwaara gaittiya kaardiyaati simmettoosona.\n`__operator_list__:Available __operator_list__:Blocked` *Blocked* woykko *Available* giya sunttay de'iya ay mazgabaa giddon de'iya kaardiyaata simmissees.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Dumma dumma oottiyaabati *QASSI* gididi gaittettoosona. Dumma oottiyaabata ubbaara gaittiya kaardiyaati xalla simmettoosona. `__operator_list__:Available __operator_label__:red` *zo'o* malaatay de'iya *Available* mazgabaa giddon de'iya kaardiyaata xalla simmissees.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "Gallassati loo'o woykko iitta kumetta qoodan woykko ha77i wodiyaas `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` woykko `__predicate_year__` go'ettidi erissettana danddayoosona.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "Xaafuwaa koyiyoogee gita woykko guutha birshshettaa dummayissenna.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "Gishetan naago sohuwaa efettida kaardiyaati koyettokkona.",
